2. Conceptual Inspiration Acknowledgment:
   TooPower Browser is conceptually inspired by the TaskSpace and batch
   JavaScript execution paradigm pioneered by EGo Browser (https://lite.ego.app/
   by Citro Labs). While EGo Browser focuses on a macOS desktop experience and
   enterprise security/governance controls, TooPower Browser is an independent,
   100% open-source implementation written from scratch to empower consumers
   and developers across Windows, Linux, and macOS with full local cookie
   sovereignty and zero external dependencies.
